WEBVTT

00:15:58.412 --> 00:16:02.249
and therefore how globalization
needs to transform.

00:16:04.126 --> 00:16:05.877
Fourth,

00:16:05.919 --> 00:16:07.087
innovation.

00:16:08.338 --> 00:16:10.841
All of this can only happen

00:16:10.882 --> 00:16:14.803
if we start shifting our thinking
about innovation.

00:16:15.887 --> 00:16:17.973
Innovation in our times

00:16:18.015 --> 00:16:21.810
is about bringing back economic footprint
within planetary boundaries.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:24.896
Anything else, even the coolest
of new products,

00:16:24.938 --> 00:16:29.109
if it isn't aligned with that goal,
it's not innovation,

00:16:29.109 --> 00:16:30.694
it's business as usual.